{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07566","headline":"江有枫一篇十章 五 · 萧颖士","name":"江有枫一篇十章 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"粤东可居，彼吴之墟。\n有田有庭，有朋有书。\n有蓴有鱼，君子居焉。\n惟以宴醑，其乐徐徐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧颖士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07566.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07566","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}